vailable in parallel builds.\n\nComplete Example\n----------------\n\nSuppose you want to build every ``requests`` release from 2.28 onward.\n\n**1. Create a requirements file**\n\n.. code-block:: text\n\n   requests>=2.28","numLines":25,"startLine":95,"totalLines":156}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TTC8yCtDWtWddBBAraufSt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
